# Route: guide 16 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 37 to
# 39, 26 quests, 2.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Arathi Highlands, Loch Modan): Thandol Span -> Refuge Pointe ->
# Boulder'gor -> Northfold Manor -> Boulder'gor -> Refuge Pointe -> Go'Shek
# Farm -> Circle of Outer Binding -> Go'Shek Farm -> Circle of East Binding ->
# Hammerfall -> Circle of West Binding -> Circle of Inner Binding -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Wanted!  Marez Cowl (684; Marez
# Cowl 40); Wanted!  Otto and Falconcrest (685; Otto 38, Lord Falconcrest 40);
# Stromgarde Badges (682; Syndicate Prowler 36-37, Syndicate Conjuror 35-36,
# Syndicate Magus 37-38); Breaking the Keystone (652; Fozruk 42); Trelane's
# Defenses (694; Boulderfist Shaman 38-39); The Shattered Necklace (2198;
# Shadowforge Surveyor 35-36, Shadowforge Ruffian 36-37, Shadowforge Digger
# 35-36, Stonevault Rockchewer 36-37, Stonevault Oracle 37-38, Stonevault Cave
# Hunter 36-37).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

